// PPM - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

# A real binary PPM (P6). Same header grammar as PGM, plus three samples
# per pixel: "Hello World!" rides in the comment where PGM put it.
0000  50 36 0A 23 20 48 65 6C 6C 6F 20 57 6F 72 6C 64 |P6.# Hello World|
0010  21 0A 31 20 31 0A 32 35 35 0A 48 65 6C          |!.1 1.255.Hel|
